{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会、個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっっぅくくくくさんの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれて、久々の2期生レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんが途中で抜けてしまったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく握手出来て良かったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてきいちゃんお大事にしなはれや(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月は鎌倉の鶴岡八幡宮に行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじを引いてきたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと 凶 でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見なかったことにしてメンバー皆で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社に行った時に引いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吉でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじに頼らずいこう（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会の時の洋服です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/01/11/0527115/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで初詣は幼馴染と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔から家族ぐるみで仲がいいので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで鎌倉の鶴岡八幡宮に行ってきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも屋台が目の前にあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご飴とかあんず飴とかなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かるんだけど、まさかの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご飴とぶどう飴っていうのも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あってびっくりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれ食べようか7分くらい迷って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご飴買って食べました 〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋台の雰囲気とか匂いが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこか懐かしいし、食べたくなるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンションあがるの、ヒェイ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの屋台で食べるなら必ずこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう定番は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各地方によって屋台にでてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物とかって違うのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それもきになる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ教えてください(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/01/11/0527115/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は名古屋の握手会の時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泊まったホテルなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんから渡された"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋番号の鍵が「404号室」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてあってしかも1人部屋だったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場にいた絢音に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い怖い怖いってずっと言ってました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な